aSv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98aed62b-103e-48c9-9469-cd81733de373","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"raa0121さんのこのコメント:\n\u0026gt; キリスト教には、カトリックとプロテスタント以外に、\n\u0026gt; ローマ正教、イギリス清教、ロシア成教、天草式十字凄教 があるって、とある魔術の禁書目録が教えてくれた！\nの「ローマ正教、イギリス清教、ロシア成教、天草式十字凄教」の宗教組織の名称の最後が「せいきょう」になっていますね。\n\n宗教の話題において、「教」と「会」の意味が近いのでうっかり「せいきょう」でなく「せいかい」と誤読してしまいましたｗ。「正解」も「せいかい」として読むのでダジャレかなと思っちゃいましたｗ。","ts":"1614940643.017800","thread_ts":"1614870191.015900","edited":{"user":"U01EMNN9XNG","ts":"1614941300.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U01ATUT6PL3","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LaOlE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f081ac2-4c1a-4443-a924-b78d3042b047","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":"日本語能力を育むよう頑張ります…","ts":"1614940860.018000","thread_ts":"1614870191.015900","parent_user_id":"U01ATUT6PL3","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2fte"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30a8bf7a-948f-4a0b-a9e3-72c9e026d644","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"理解しました。私も「せいかい」つながりかな〜と空目したのですごく日本人的感覚といえると思います :+1:","ts":"1614943259.018500","thread_ts":"1614870191.015900","parent_user_id":"U01ATUT6PL3","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"v7t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c021450a-779e-4ef3-bf28-92d5de472fe8","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"（謎理論）","ts":"1614943265.018700","thread_ts":"1614870191.015900","parent_user_id":"U01ATUT6PL3","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yiNpw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a198c8dc-e439-4ef4-b90b-aa4b52c7ca5b","type":"message","user":"U01EMNN9XNG","text":":jigsaw:","ts":"1614950146.018900","thread_ts":"1614870191.015900","parent_user_id":"U01ATUT6PL3","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks"